    {
      "sample_index": 1,
      "text": "The average value of a set of numbers is found by summing all the numbers and dividing by the count of numbers.\n\nFor the given set of numbers $0$, $2z$, $4z$, $8z$, and $16z$, we first find the sum:\n\n\\[\n0 + 2z + 4z + 8z + 16z = (0 + 2z + 4z + 8z + 16z) = 30z\n\\]\n\nNext, we divide the sum by the count of numbers, which is 5:\n\n\\[\n\\text{Average value} = \\frac{30z}{5} = 6z\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the average value of $0$, $2z$, $4z$, $8z$, and $16z$ is \\boxed{6z}.",
